{"id":10000071,"name":"赛诺","enName":"Cyno","title":"缄秘的裁遣","element":"雷","region":"须弥","rarity":5,"weapon":"长柄武器","birthday":"6月23日","constellation":"金狼座","description":"教令院内负责监管学者们的「大风纪官」。工作时比刹诃伐罗学院制作的「大风机关」更有效率。","affiliation":"缄默之殿","cv":{"chinese":"李轻扬","japanese":"入野自由","english":"亚历杭德罗·萨博","korean":"郑义陈&李宇梨"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000071-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000071-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Cyno.zip","voicePackageEn":"Cyno","quoteCount":76,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面·过往","desc":"我是赛诺，曾经的「大风纪官」。如今我正在以自己的力量审判罪恶，若你同样心系规则与正义，我可以助你一臂之力。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_draw_appear_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f9/cmmktzfmp2op71e5jtti4rdpvauyxcw.mp3"},{"title":"初次见面·如今","desc":"我是赛诺，教令院的「大风纪官」。维护规则、审判罪恶是我的职责，今后的旅途中，我会保护好你的安全。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_draw_appear_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/86/e03b1rd6xynrhnb6qdtzwkwrpjulv9k.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·称重","desc":"善与恶，最终都会被称量。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5d/cr47xmjr3p77hr6hx5gsru01ztr6tvk.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·牌运","desc":"运势会左右某一场对决的胜负，但不会一直影响下去。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/mbp8su4i0zb9imisphm46ore0ohyqwm.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·疑惑","desc":"偶尔我也想缓解一下气氛，但我其实分不太清什么笑话能够引人发笑。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e0/75pi1cpzfyevtquhk9ml81z9ftucuqn.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"又下雨了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/80/tpt4596ddtmb1s43j3qccnf7iwudupa.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"在一些传说中，雷电是神明对人间降下的审判。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/62/nhtna4homqcjz0d671ic07k31laa10i.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"我很喜欢下雪后的世界，安静却并非一片死寂。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/df/9c883yohp1h6yz1fd77qa394tv1hiwq.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"阳光终会照进每一个角落。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c3/ex5zf8x4sb5p215h98ftbd0u5gibi5b.mp3"},{"title":"刮大风了…","desc":"好大的风…当心。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_weather_gale_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a2/j79wqdk8hlfqe29qrozwlqpxhtp4ho7.mp3"},{"title":"在沙漠的时候…","desc":"熟悉的风景…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_weather_desert_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c6/c8aqmpcj67wul260lquu877hj08s1hw.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"打起精神，该出发了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e6/le73xut7xs241ixin6zeojhoh31hl7u.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"需要我准备午饭吗？事先说好，我可不保证好吃。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/pl542dpm03qpcx322lxfpa9stuxi935.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"还记得我跟你说过的话吗？夜晚总是伴随着危险，无论做什么都不要放松警惕。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/32/aobwvzyawi46cu7c3a3j6t60m2eonsw.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"晚安。一些罪犯在附近活动，我去处理。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/42/osurl5804nladyhu9zkpe816f9kb4u5.mp3"},{"title":"关于赛诺自己·冷笑话","desc":"有一个旅人在沙漠中口渴无比，于是祈祷自己遇到一只水史莱姆，没想到一只饿着肚子的水史莱姆也在祈祷自己遇见落单的旅人…嗯？你那是什么表情，不好笑吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3e/3rkbp42pfgmivp1xrpvgrt1gc7dhu10.mp3"},{"title":"关于赛诺自己·散步","desc":"我偶尔会去夜晚的沙漠散步，寒冷而干涩的风让人头脑清醒。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/39/oiq7zgcgds2km71c78pqb3orihdxx6n.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·决斗","desc":"要打一把「七圣召唤」吗？给你看看我的新卡组。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a3/69jwoiylpe0z9oary8wyyd9we77gm1a.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·此刻","desc":"过去无法更改，未来无法预料，所以我很珍惜眼前的时光。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6b/tca6hzx9fi21m5vldd3ohuu75e4s3n9.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"凭依在我身上的非人之物也好，将视线投射于我的魔神也罢，我受神明青睐，但我无意为此而改变自己的道义。我只尽我应尽之责，做我应做之事。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c3/r3gyoqpujcnn3wagdgex62m1sc4abg1.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享·求知欲","desc":"「欲望泛滥就会引发灾害」，这似乎已经是一种共识。然而提及「求知欲」的时候，人们却往往只愿意谈论它的正面作用…在我看来，求知欲也是欲望的一种，必须加以控制。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2d/rprzpccq90nfhozfxxk1c36zrzidvk9.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享·敬畏心","desc":"在执行任务时，我的任何一个判断都可能会改变他人的命运。所以我必须要求自己时刻对「风纪官」这个职位保持敬畏——就像我敬畏知识与力量一样。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_dialog_share_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/37/larpdyfzj8lzjljvfrn0xvjir5pk9gn.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"我喜欢生长在沙漠中的那些灌木。沙漠象征着归寂，一切文明都会被风沙掩埋。但就在这片荒凉的土地上，却能见到生命不断萌发的迹象，有时连我也会被它们的坚韧震撼。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b0/19yg5w8di9ddexzxokdzbk0jcguzoup.mp3"},{"title":"关于提纳里·知识","desc":"提纳里和我见过的其他学者不同。他对知识同样有着很深的执着，却始终不会逾越那道红线。有些学者会将自己视为「实验室中的神明」，但提纳里不会，他一直平等地尊重每一种生命。听说他拒绝了教令院的聘请，我也站在他这一边。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_teammate_tighnari_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0d/6399bj3okhlbojzd5i3sppvigs5d2go.mp3"},{"title":"关于提纳里·笑话","desc":"提纳里曾劝我不要在饭桌上讲笑话，说是根本笑不出来。我不以为然，连讲了三个压箱底的笑话，并逐一解释了笑点…然后我的饭菜凉了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_teammate_tighnari_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d3/nbujf3ui7ovv62djqqmys068wx6hz7l.mp3"},{"title":"关于柯莱…","desc":"我曾经帮她封印了体内的魔神残骸，但封印的过程给她带来了很大的痛苦。那种程度的痛苦可能比死亡更让人害怕，她能够坚持下来，很了不起。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_teammate_collei_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5c/6wshaopk7iqyy49hmwivj9078ocynvv.mp3"},{"title":"关于艾尔海森…","desc":"我不太喜欢过于聪明的人，他们总是自认为能掌控一切，从而经常在危险的边缘游走。不过艾尔海森还算稳定，在绝大部分场合，他确实有掌控局面、化险为夷的能力。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_teammate_alhaitham_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d6/ekhcjxeresaq776azddjjad84z724zf.mp3"},{"title":"关于卡维…","desc":"提纳里和柯莱没有亲口说出来，但他们之间的眼神交流已经说明了一切。卡维分享的亲身经历比我准备的笑话有趣多了。我的看法？我觉得他们会为这种事情发笑，反倒是挺好笑的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_teammate_kaveh_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6d/3zk84953kk110sofv9v1gxljbj1b29s.mp3"},{"title":"关于纳西妲…","desc":"评价神明…这在我看来是略微有些僭越的事情。不过在同行的那段时间里，我也亲眼见证了她的智慧、勇气与决心。相较于那些只靠臆想就对她指指点点的贤者，我应该更有资格下这个结论：她是一位优秀的、值得尊敬的神明。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_teammate_nahida_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fe/3fxzxhr5hnv53e3eqx16ctgr4294hjk.mp3"},{"title":"关于妮露…","desc":"我能从她身上感到对舞蹈的热情与执念，这份执念非常坚定，不会轻易改变。希望以后，她也可以用自己热爱的舞蹈为他人带去快乐。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_teammate_nilou_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e6/n8wyy8ua908uwhxuh215eqrulnm7ld5.mp3"},{"title":"关于珐露珊…","desc":"我曾仔细翻阅过记载珐露珊前辈失踪的案卷，那时候我怀疑她进行了某种危险的研究…不过与她见面之后，我就彻底打消了这个念头。虽然相处起来有些困难，不过她就像一位喜欢絮絮叨叨的长辈，心里会为他人着想，不会做什么出格的事情。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_teammate_faruzan_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/15/axbvctdolcmieip5ehi1hk8zc1eh7gv.mp3"},{"title":"关于丽莎…","desc":"丽莎和我曾向同一位贤者求学，我自然知道她的事。身为大风纪官，我也见过许多过分追求知识而引发的悲剧，所以能理解她的选择。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_teammate_lisa_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e0/nycmlpbyiis82vfa257sam7982t108c.mp3"},{"title":"关于赛索斯…","desc":"赛索斯很有责任心，我绝对认可他作为战士的能力，也钦佩他的勇气。他也帮了我很多，有他在，教令院与缄默之殿的合作一定会更顺利。\n不过我觉得他身上还有一处欠缺，就是牌打得太少。每次见面我都邀请他打几局，他总有事在身，要吃饭了、有事要办、要去见朋友…全是借口！他在须弥城最熟的朋友不就我们几个吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_teammate_sethos_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bc/9h63rmz2i3tsk58vxx7fy4r8rvrmb4n.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解赛诺·其一","desc":"你问关于我的事？也是，毕竟在很多人眼中我是一个无法忽视的「麻烦」…不用担心，只要你不做什么危险的事情，我就不会找你的麻烦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/96/bpoilk1b3udmtl0oqt1dy5ai9km7mvs.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解赛诺·其二","desc":"以此身为容器，可以令非人之物的力量显现。这既得益于先天的体质，也是一种后天的交易。没什么可避讳的，我以风纪官的身份称量世间的罪恶，自然也要把我自己的灵魂放到审判之秤上一同称量。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/ff/2k9nvhshucv5lrzjyvrrl7o92vwlj0m.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解赛诺·其三","desc":"比起「为什么做」，我更看重「做了什么」。因为这个世界上有成千上万种理由，有时你听到那些理由，会觉得做了错事的人情有可原，甚至觉得旁人对他们太过苛责。劣势方总是容易引起别人的同情，但审判者却要摒弃这种情绪。情有可原，但罪无可赦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/77/hbz46ep2gjv0wrksomjldqzugs6nzz6.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解赛诺·其四","desc":"在幽暗的无知之海上，偶尔会泛起微光，吸引着不明真相的人靠近。常有人视其为灯塔，却看不到漆黑的海水中隐藏的巨大危险。将久居在黑暗中的人带离光明的指引，本身是一件残酷的事情，但我不得不这么做——直到未来有一天，我们能够战胜海水中潜藏的敌人为止。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c4/5hdvcdqtadabqnfvd7346ggblgm1x45.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解赛诺·其五","desc":"我判断有价值的信息，已经如数分享了，你还在期待听我说什么？哈…你的好奇心真是不简单，那就由你提问吧。习惯了审问别人之后，这种被人询问的感觉…也算新奇。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ab/b5v78v0jb59hy4ahzymfwwmx27y0wmk.mp3"},{"title":"赛诺的爱好…","desc":"闲暇的时候，我会和其他人打几局「七圣召唤」。这种建立在规则之上，却又充满灵活变通的游戏，在我看来更像是一种艺术。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8b/t3ne5j75pi4gpfliqdwkokxsssipcgl.mp3"},{"title":"赛诺的烦恼…","desc":"前段时间，我看到了一本来自稻妻的轻小说。小说以「七圣召唤」为主题，里面的主角被逼入绝境的时候，忽然从卡组中抽到了一张原本不存在的卡。我深受震撼，同时也陷入困惑：通过对卡组进行特殊操作，创造出让人摸不着头脑的奇迹，这究竟是打破了规则，还是也算规则的一部分？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/nf0cwb05n5ffhp45ilg0s0f9ohh9i8t.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"大米与肉类、干果混合，加酸奶进行烤制，不同的香味会混合到一起。敲开焦脆的外壳，香味就会随着蒸腾的热气一同冒出来。制作起来也不会花太长时间，是我很喜欢的菜肴。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_pref_foodLike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/04/k8vjilw5ow2io9s9w5crkhdjhog8rby.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"在沙漠中行走的时候，带的干粮通常坚硬无味，习惯之后就没有什么讨厌的东西了。非要说的话，跟虫子有关的食物还是有些难以接受…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b2/cjp0uu95lelv5njs21m4tchaih1knb6.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"味道很好，劳你费心了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ea/pvefshb7q10c1pxg1vyculeziqkxyc7.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"我收下了，多谢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9f/b21it4612oj0cksxu5mgpx6czyu801h.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"给我的吗？是不是搞错了？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3f/ixgl3uh4hfpnl8kssr8zxvzmyapz2c8.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"嗯…先祝你生日快乐。虽然没有太多庆祝的经验，不过想到是你的生日，我还是提前做了一些准备。首先是一套我研究了几天后得到的卡组构筑，风格和你比较契合。另外我调整了这段时间的安排，你有什么想去的地方吗？我可以陪你一起去。虽然生日只有一天，但放松还是需要尽兴，行程安排在三天内即可。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6c/c3utrlrd3u10buxrrrkevfk9gmikps7.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"我能感受到新的力量，这是变强的证明。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/08/ibvko6l7z77sq5ekdfl46yjzkir34i3.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"审判罪恶，维护规则。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/21/45yl9wh64b8izbxdacs2frxogksbpe1.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"不错的提升，多谢你了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/rrb81acogx7bhmlx63rxlxzj93owwm0.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"力量已达顶峰，然而仅靠这一身武力，仍旧有许多做不到的事情。人情与规则许多时候相互冲突，如何更好地兼顾，我会在今后的旅途中寻找答案。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/45/bo0k113zbzlyk86inenmjvagppkxtyb.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"束手就擒吧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/57/2tetfwyj21iq5fafan4moaxmo6strca.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"徒劳的挣扎。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4f/b42eu85c5jfuezkgntjdd3ydvam71s4.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"你无处可逃！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/8m66a4co1jqzratf1m9b4ogm6pf0jr9.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其四","desc":"裁决已至。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_battle_skill1_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/17/eun1evbsg7iuos1ywqgckcng0t1tmfu.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其五","desc":"该定罪了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_battle_skill1_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/55/c9e3e681ozpr62murwp2w1fwe5wv8b7.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其六","desc":"偿还罪业！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_battle_skill1_06","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/85/i8xa4becy5zfl461dmfrogkjrywxodx.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"以此身…肃正万象！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5c/1d8ur6nwk4fz8v6xp2s6ojdm7ihlc5i.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"判决，如期降临。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7a/3qjb3nd4y5p4pukeip740gc94dawbg2.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"称量，你的罪孽。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/03/8mogpgs7paxdphzzu1e7nhr8yfh7ujc.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"应得之物。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/24/d13xe65subf55pna622yxl30c1iz98x.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"贵在恒心。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5f/c83e8qrew7zxvd6k8cooj9brclwm7va.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"财富积累，成为文明的基石。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ae/sktpmtrmf4sb3c0n8x9d1odfw9kn149.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"威胁程度…比预想中要高。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/88/6an3kquk5yuib528xbug8q3bc18l3ed.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"差不多也该习惯了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/af/h5vjjvhectjhitsrzh674qi62barhlc.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"咳…再来！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e8/cx5qwtmp5ofsms3bd3nyup0tmrrqes9.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"去休整，别逞强！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/44/5bcwn6gul7u6svogn6vjfhhmn6jk175.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"我来替你。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ed/m3hu7hudp4hgcfq9ilyqyydn2y0axy0.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"轮到我了吗…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/pvkmfo6km3hmv7tfs7ynsyetpd7jcph.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"覆灭…新生…终而复始。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2e/si6b2kfs81dcph77g6s2uqd833t7xro.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"审判，失败了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/01/iudrz3lj3l2nh572me1764li05nq846.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"无用的挣扎。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_battle_hit_L_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d5/ppofrqfzytahrg8wrunq6ushk3l7vj1.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"真难对付。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e7/m1uftxrq6s76bscrdtl7z2xcev2c18b.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"有两下子。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_cyno/vo_cyno_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/de/sr080x7r5enazu2hyd9x9mlyosmy0ow.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"我会尽我所能。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_cyno_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ae/9k1g6xeuogjqh5fd948mcahpqjas2so.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"行动开始。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_cyno_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f6/9w9mk3k56qzwaagd9fm09qluwojs6km.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"这次的目标是谁？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_cyno_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d4/29mlkjy8lkio7xu7paeo098zloqhu7p.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000071-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000071-full.webp","fullArtWidth":959,"fullArtHeight":1000}